## Run it

```bash
uv sync
uv run arena run --mock      # offline, no key, checks the pipeline
cp .env.example .env         # add OPENROUTER_API_KEY
uv run arena run             # real calls; cached, so reruns only pay for what's new
uv run arena snapshot        # dated snapshot + snapshots/latest.json for the hub
```

Add a contender: one entry in `contenders.yaml`. Change the task: edit
`src/__PACKAGE__/dataset.py` (items and `score`) and `src/__PACKAGE__/contenders.py`.

