## How the pick is made

Fixed rules in [arena-kit](https://github.com/SeijiMatsumoto/arenas/tree/main/kit), no LLM: a
contender ties the best one when it is within 2 points and an exact paired McNemar test doesn't
show it is worse; the pick is the cheapest and fastest of the tied contenders.

## Caveats

- Starter dataset is tiny and hand-written; replace it before drawing conclusions.
